(text "console-usb: the console with no radio in use. See hardware/console-usb/README.md.\nEvery connection is a name: a net label or a power symbol at the end of each pin's stub." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 264.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b252f482-5b45-435f-9c99-db0eb301ee6e"))
(text "The link. The USB-C's D+ and D- reach the CH340C and nothing else.\nTXD/RXD go to UART1 (GPIO18/17); MicroPython's REPL is never there.\nDTR and RTS are NOT connected, on purpose: the computer can't reset\nthe S3 or start its bootloader. Don't add auto-reset." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 5.08 193.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "28625c05-4030-4a6d-b7a2-135750b045cc"))
(text "LNA_IN floats and there is no antenna: the firmware never starts the radio\n(Espressif's checklist: an antenna is needed only if RF is enabled).\nFlash and PSRAM are in the package: SPI* and GPIO26 stay unconnected." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 96.52 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8a56f47b-0ac8-4e11-bc4f-2f2cddcba076"))
(text "J2: pin order from the seller's listing. Check it on the panel before the layout." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254.0 91.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "582cf5d7-ae57-43ba-81d1-a37197ee37ea"))
(text "J3 is not fitted: holes for a header at the bench. UART0 is the REPL\nand the ROM's flasher (hold D0, press RESET). Nothing reaches it\nthrough the USB-C." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 350.52 101.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9ef95d0d-f724-46af-b6e7-d85482e0f957"))
